# Smart contracts.
#
# Dependencies and Hardhat build output are reproducible from
# smart-contracts/package-lock.json, so they are not published. The Solidity
# sources, tests, deployable ABI/bytecode package and deployments/arc-testnet.json
# ARE published: they are the verifiable record of the Arc deployment.
smart-contracts/node_modules/
smart-contracts/artifacts/
smart-contracts/cache/
smart-contracts/coverage/
smart-contracts/.env
smart-contracts/.env.*
!smart-contracts/.env.example
